    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/752353d648cccc784acef7b8efd27553.poster.avif?t=1752573118\" width=478 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/752353d648cccc784acef7b8efd27553.webm?t=1752573118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/752353d648cccc784acef7b8efd27553.mp4?t=1752573118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <strong>Bearzerk</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bearzerk is a survivorlike teddy apocalypse where plush meets pandemonium. Strap in for a bullet-riddled, stuffing-soaked descent into madness. Pick your weird teddy. Gear up. Unleash chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features (Early Access)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15+ Playable Teddies (and counting)</strong>: From possessed plushes to axe-wielding samurais and chicken-mounted maniacs, each bear brings unique perks, quirks, and synergy madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ Weapons &amp; 70+ Armor Items/Perks</strong>: Launch toast. Brand enemies with infernal irons. Spin like a blender. It's your build. It's your funeral.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/ec0f3280d79f15a66e07ee9ff1b444e9.poster.avif?t=1752573118\" width=800 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/ec0f3280d79f15a66e07ee9ff1b444e9.webm?t=1752573118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/ec0f3280d79f15a66e07ee9ff1b444e9.mp4?t=1752573118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mounts, Pets &amp; Ridiculous Allies</strong>: Visit the all-new Mount Shop to unlock chaotic companions, combat mounts, and sentient snacks. Some bite. Some bark. All help shred.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There's still a goat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/fad04df4c2a5547895b725824cabf6a5.avif?t=1752573118\" width=131 height=160 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 Waves of Mayhem</strong>: Battle escalating horrors in wave-based arenas full of stitched nightmares and pixelated bloodshed.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong>: When 20 waves isn't enough, go infinite. Score-chasers welcome. Sanity optional.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can make friends with Carlos - he's a duck in a hat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/1c34d8a3a63946f8270dc4ee6ccf6292.poster.avif?t=1752573118\" width=424 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/1c34d8a3a63946f8270dc4ee6ccf6292.webm?t=1752573118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/1c34d8a3a63946f8270dc4ee6ccf6292.mp4?t=1752573118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses, Mini-Bosses, and BIG Bears</strong>: Hulking monstrosities with patterns, personality, and zero chill. New ones being stitched up right now.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synergy-Building Chaos</strong>: Every item stacks. Every perk matters. Build broken runs, summon carnage, and laugh as your FPS shudders under the weight of furry explosions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scroll of Stitches (Meta Progression)</strong>: Unlock permanent upgrades and game-altering perks between runs. Buff your base stats and grow terrifying over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Content Incoming</strong>: Expect more characters, bosses, enemies, maps, mounts, modifiers, pets, events, and full feature creep throughout Early Access.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/facaf9a76436472c5b7e3ad7d62f89f7.avif?t=1752573118\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Big guys. Big weapons. Bigger problems.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's Bearzerk All About?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bearzerk is a horde survival auto-shooter where every run is an experiment in chaotic buildcraft. Draft synergy-packed loadouts, discover cursed gear, and unleash escalating carnage against wave after wave of stitched monstrosities. It's fast, it's weird, and it's all about finding busted combos that snowball into beautiful, fluffy disaster.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/a7f415fceea32fd5eeae95c8483abe06.avif?t=1752573118\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bearzerk is updating constantly. Jump in. Get weird. And may the fluff be ever in your favor.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/752353d648cccc784acef7b8efd27553.poster.avif?t=1752573118\" width=478 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/752353d648cccc784acef7b8efd27553.webm?t=1752573118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/752353d648cccc784acef7b8efd27553.mp4?t=1752573118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <strong>Bearzerk</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bearzerk is a survivorlike teddy apocalypse where plush meets pandemonium. Strap in for a bullet-riddled, stuffing-soaked descent into madness. Pick your weird teddy. Gear up. Unleash chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features (Early Access)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15+ Playable Teddies (and counting)</strong>: From possessed plushes to axe-wielding samurais and chicken-mounted maniacs, each bear brings unique perks, quirks, and synergy madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ Weapons &amp; 70+ Armor Items/Perks</strong>: Launch toast. Brand enemies with infernal irons. Spin like a blender. It's your build. It's your funeral.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/ec0f3280d79f15a66e07ee9ff1b444e9.poster.avif?t=1752573118\" width=800 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/ec0f3280d79f15a66e07ee9ff1b444e9.webm?t=1752573118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/ec0f3280