g Chaos</strong>: Every item stacks. Every perk matters. Build broken runs, summon carnage, and laugh as your FPS shudders under the weight of furry explosions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scroll of Stitches (Meta Progression)</strong>: Unlock permanent upgrades and game-altering perks between runs. Buff your base stats and grow terrifying over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Content Incoming</strong>: Expect more characters, bosses, enemies, maps, mounts, modifiers, pets, events, and full feature creep throughout Early Access.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/facaf9a76436472c5b7e3ad7d62f89f7.avif?t=1752573118\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Big guys. Big weapons. Bigger problems.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's Bearzerk All About?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bearzerk is a horde survival auto-shooter where every run is an experiment in chaotic buildcraft. Draft synergy-packed loadouts, discover cursed gear, and unleash escalating carnage against wave after wave of stitched monstrosities. It's fast, it's weird, and it's all about finding busted combos that snowball into beautiful, fluffy disaster.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545290/extras/a7f415fceea32fd5eeae95c8483abe06.avif?t=1752573118\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bearzerk is updating constantly. Jump in. Get weird. And may the fluff be ever in your favor.</i></p>",
